MND can present itself in children or in adults. If the onset is during childhood then it’s usually inherited and in most of the cases it is[ Familial] Amyotropic L[ateral] Sclerosis. In adults usually it’s found to affect after age of 40years.
Most of the cases of MND tend to progress during course of time and worsen and in many cases they are even fatal depending on type of MND, say for instance ALS is a fatal type where as PLS is not.
